<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>BANK			  RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			     3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 11.50 /11.40  11.825/11.725  12.20 /12.10</p>
<p>BPI			 11.60 /11.40  11.90 /11.70   12.25 /12.10</p>
<p>Citibank		  11.50 /11.40  11.80 /11.70   12.25 /12.10</p>
<p>Metrobank		 11.55 /11.40  12.00 /11.80   12.10 /12.00</p>
<p>PNB			 11.50 /11.40  11.825/11.715  12.15 /12.05</p>
<p>Solidbank		 11.50 /11.425 11.80 /11.725  12.15 /12.075</p>
<p>StanChart		 11.50 /11.40  11.785/11.70   12.15 /12.05</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone on (632) 841 8934</p>
